  2174	
  2175	# PLAN-185 W1 (writer 4/7) — the settings destination is answered ONCE, here,
  2176	# before any test on it derives a decision. THREE consumers read that answer:
  2177	# SETTINGS_PRE_EXISTING immediately below, build_settings, and
  2178	# apply_deny_baseline — and every one of them asks with `-e`/`-f`, which follow
  2179	# symlinks. A DANGLING link at .claude/settings.json therefore answered
